[
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"tech,formation,technique,education\" >\n    \n    \n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">Méthodologie : ce qu'une ligne doit franchir avant d'être publiée</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">La mécanique complète : collecte datée avec contrat de date, contrôles bloquants qui rendent un code de sortie, panel adversarial avant publication, trades scellés en ajout seul. Et ce que « on ne sait pas » déclenche ici — un refus, pas une estimation.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\" style=\"flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem\">\n    <a href=\"/tech/methodologie/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Voir l'article</a>\n    </div>\n</div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"ai,tech,architecture,formation\" >\n    \n    \n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">3,5 millions de tokens par jour : autopsie d'une facture LLM</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">Un pipeline multi-agents consommait 3,5 M de tokens en 24 h. Diagnostic poste par poste : le modèle le plus cher partout, des relecteurs-agents qui refont ce qu'un script vérifie gratuitement, des données volumineuses transportées dans le contexte. Les trois règles qui ont ramené la facture de 1,4 M à 827 k sur un produit équivalent.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\" style=\"flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem\">\n    <a href=\"/tech/autopsie-tokens/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Voir l'article</a>\n    </div>\n</div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"tech,ai,architecture,formation\" >\n    \n    \n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">Un pipeline de publication qui sait dire non</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">Gates bloquants (fraîcheur datée, validation quantitative, détecteur de tics), trois états au lieu de deux, panel adversarial avant mise en ligne. Le jour où un relecteur a recompté « 17 » et trouvé 15, et pourquoi refuser de publier est une fonctionnalité, pas une panne.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\" style=\"flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem\">\n    <a href=\"/tech/pipeline-qui-refuse/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Voir l'article</a>\n    </div>\n</div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"tech,architecture,securite,formation\" >\n    \n    \n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">Append-only ou rien</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">Pourquoi un registre de publications et de trades ne se réécrit jamais : les écritures perdues du read-modify-write (4 survivantes sur 20), la republication en double qui en découle, la chaîne d'intégrité SHA-256 sur 299 trades scellés, et un quota d'envoi gardé par un jeton à usage unique.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\" style=\"flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem\">\n    <a href=\"/tech/append-only/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Voir l'article</a>\n    </div>\n</div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"eu,etf,education,technique,formation\" >\n    \n    \n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">Fiscalité & wrappers : l'alpha caché du retail européen (PEA, PEA-PME, CTO, UCITS)</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">Le PEA fait travailler vos gains sans frottement fiscal : après 5 ans, zéro impôt sur le revenu, seuls les prélèvements sociaux restent. Un avantage composé qu'un retail américain n'a pas. Exemple chiffré CTO vs PEA sur 10 ans, contrainte UCITS (pourquoi vous ne pouvez pas acheter SPY), et le seul paramètre qui fait exploser l'écart : le turnover.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\" style=\"flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem\">\n    <a href=\"/tech/fiscalite-pea/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Voir l'article</a>\n    </div>\n</div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"tech,technique,education,momentum\" >\n    \n    \n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">Pourquoi la Plupart des Alertes de Trading Sont du Bruit</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">La méthode pour trier une alerte : plancher de bruit ATR, rapport risque/récompense compté depuis la première cible, réconciliation à une seule source, invalidation conditionnelle et contexte de régime. Exemple chiffré vérifié.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\" style=\"flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem\">\n    <a href=\"/tech/pourquoi-les-alertes-sont-du-bruit/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Voir l'article</a>\n    </div>\n</div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"formation,ai,tech\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #7c3aed99); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-network-wired\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 0; color: #7c3aed; font-weight: 700;\">Architecture IA</h3><div class=\"report-card-meta\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.7rem;\">2026</div></div></div><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">Workflows Multi-Agents : Orchestrer des Escouades d’Agents IA</h2><p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">Guide technique sur l'orchestration multi-agents : fan-out parallèle, pipelines, vérification adverse (war rooms), panels de juges, boucles jusqu'à épuisement. Patterns concrets, schémas, arbitrages coût/latence, et un cas réel sur le scanner DailyTickers.</p><div class=\"actions\" style=\"flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem\"><a href=\"/tech/workflows-multi-agents/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Voir l'article</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"formation,ai,tech\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #0891b2\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0891b2, #0891b299); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-plug\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 0; color: #0891b2; font-weight: 700;\">MCP & Data</h3><div class=\"report-card-meta\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.7rem;\">2026</div></div></div><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem\">MCP en Pratique : Brancher Claude sur tes Données de Marché</h2><p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">Le Model Context Protocol expliqué pour les builders : ce qu'est un serveur MCP, outils vs ressources, comment un modèle découvre et appelle un outil, synchrone vs asynchrone (job polling), résultats structurés. Et pourquoi MCP change tout pour brancher un agent sur des données de marché temps réel.</p><div class=\"actions\" style=\"flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem\"><a href=\"/tech/mcp-donnees-marche/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Voir l'article</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"en\" data-tags=\"tech,ai,formation\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #0284c7\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #0284c799); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-server\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800\">Financial Data APIs — The Complete Guide</h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">5 parts · Intermediate · EN</span></div></div><p>Price data, fundamentals, sentiment, options & derivatives, and building your own data aggregator.</p><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\"><span class=\"badge badge-green\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">5 parts</span><span class=\"badge badge-blue\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">Intermediate</span><span class=\"badge badge-purple\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">EN</span></div><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/series/finance-apis/part1-price-data/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #0284c7cc); border-color: #0284c7;\">Start the Series</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"en\" data-tags=\"tech,ai,formation\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #0891b2\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0891b2, #0891b299); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-brain\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800\">AI Agents in Finance</h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">5 parts · Intermediate · EN</span></div></div><p>The paradigm shift, agent architectures, analyst agents, trading agents, and the limits and future of autonomous finance.</p><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\"><span class=\"badge badge-green\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">5 parts</span><span class=\"badge badge-blue\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">Intermediate</span><span class=\"badge badge-purple\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">EN</span></div><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/series/ai-agents-finance/part1-paradigm-shift/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0891b2, #0891b2cc); border-color: #0891b2;\">Start the Series</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"en\" data-tags=\"tech,ai,formation\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #d97706\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706, #d9770699); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800\">Quantitative Trading with Python</h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">6 parts · Intermediate · EN</span></div></div><p>Environment setup, backtesting frameworks, signal generation, risk management, live trading, and machine learning for alpha.</p><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\"><span class=\"badge badge-green\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">6 parts</span><span class=\"badge badge-blue\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">Intermediate</span><span class=\"badge badge-purple\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">EN</span></div><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/series/quant-trading-python/part1-setup/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706, #d97706cc); border-color: #d97706;\">Start the Series</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"en\" data-tags=\"tech,ai,formation\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #7c3aed99); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-plug\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800\">MCP Masterclass — Model Context Protocol</h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">5 parts · Intermediate · EN</span></div></div><p>What is MCP, building your first server, live market data integration, multi-tool orchestration, and the DailyTickers case study.</p><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\"><span class=\"badge badge-green\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">5 parts</span><span class=\"badge badge-blue\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">Intermediate</span><span class=\"badge badge-purple\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">EN</span></div><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/series/mcp-masterclass/part1-what-is-mcp/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #7c3aedcc); border-color: #7c3aed;\">Start the Series</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"en\" data-tags=\"tech,ai,formation\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #059669\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #05966999); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-desktop\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800\">Build Your Own Trading Terminal</h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">6 parts · Intermediate · EN</span></div></div><p>Architecture, data pipelines, signal engines, real-time dashboards, AI layers, and deployment.</p><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\"><span class=\"badge badge-green\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">6 parts</span><span class=\"badge badge-blue\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">Intermediate</span><span class=\"badge badge-purple\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">EN</span></div><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/series/trading-terminal/part1-architecture/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #059669cc); border-color: #059669;\">Start the Series</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"en\" data-tags=\"ai,tech,architecture\" ><h2>DailyTickers x AI Agents — MCP Data Source for Claude Code, Cursor, Gemini CLI</h2><p>Turn your AI into a premium trading desk. Auto-configured workflows, live data, smart alerts. Works with Claude Code, Cursor, Gemini CLI and more.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/mcp/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\">Voir l'article</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"en\" data-tags=\"ai,tech,trading,automation,education\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6d28d9); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-robot\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800\">The Automated Trading Stack</h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">6 parts · Expert · EN · From Manual to Fully Automated A++ Setups</span></div></div><p>Build a fully automated trading pipeline: MCP Gateway, 6-layer scoring engine, programmable alert DSL, Discord bot, scanner automation, and feedback loops.</p><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\"><span class=\"badge badge-purple\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">6 parts</span><span class=\"badge badge-blue\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">Expert</span><span class=\"badge badge-green\" style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\">English</span></div><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/tech/automated-trading/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6d28d9); border-color: #8b5cf6;\">Start the Series</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"ai,tech,architecture,education\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #10b981\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-terminal\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800\">Claude Code Entreprise — La Trilogie</h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">3 parties • Guide Avancé → Société Autonome → Growth • FR</span></div></div><p>MCP, Hooks, Scripting headless, automatisation entreprise (comptabilité, prospection, reporting), marketing autonome, veille IA, chatbot, pricing dynamique et aide à la décision.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/tech/claude-code-avance/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"background: #10b981; border-color: #10b981;\">Commencer la trilogie</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"tech,data,architecture,trading,education\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #0284c7); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chart-pie\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800\">Data Science 101 : Le Guide Complet pour le Trading</h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">Guide complet • Niveau Débutant • FR</span></div></div><p>Du Data Lake au Semantic Layer — Architecture Medallion, Star Schema, Modern Data Stack, profils data et best practices pour le trading retail.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/tech/data-science-101/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"background: #0ea5e9; border-color: #0ea5e9;\">Lire le Guide</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"tech,technique,formation,education\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #d97706\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706, #92400e); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-heart-pulse\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800\">Monitoring Trading Stack — Le Guide Complet</h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">3 parties • Post-Mortems → Architecture → Tooling • FR</span></div></div><p>Knight Capital, LTCM, Flash Crash — les catastrophes qui ont façonné le monitoring. Circuit breakers, kill switch, et tooling pratique (Docker, Grafana, Discord).</p><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/tech/monitoring-trading-stack/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706, #92400e); border-color: #d97706;\">Commencer la série</a></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"report-card\" data-lang=\"fr\" data-tags=\"tech,ai,formation,education,societe\" style=\"border-left: 4px solid #dc2626\"><div style=\"\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n    \"><div style=\"\n    width: 32px; height: 32px;\n    border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626, #f59e0b);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    \"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-filter\" style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.85rem\"></i></div><div><h3 style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; font-weight: 800\"> Signal vs Bruit : Survivre à l'Ère de l'IA </h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted)\">Essai • Société • FR</span></div></div><p> Quand tout le monde peut vibe coder, comment distinguer le signal du bruit ?\n    Concepts immuables, compétences irremplaçables, touche humaine, éducation,\n    et qui seront les riches de demain. </p><div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/tech/signal-vs-noise/\" class=\"btn-read-primary\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626, #f59e0b); border-color: #dc2626;\">Lire\n    l'Essai</a></div></div>",
